NOTICE

This is a modified version of NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl (Apache-2.0),
https://github.com/NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl (base: v1.1, commit a0732b6),
with Booster K1 support added by Kyrylo Kolesnichenko, ATR Lab, 2026.

The upstream LICENSE (Apache-2.0 for source code; NVIDIA Open Model License for NVIDIA's model weights)
and the files in legal/ apply unchanged to all upstream code. The SONIC-K1 policy weights were trained
from scratch for the Booster K1 and contain no NVIDIA model weights.

Third-party material
- Booster K1 robot description (URDF, MJCF, meshes) in gear_sonic/data/assets/robot_description/urdf/k1/
  and gear_sonic/data/assets/robot_description/mjcf/k1.xml: from BoosterRobotics/booster_assets
  (https://github.com/BoosterRobotics/booster_assets), BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2025 BoosterRobotics;
  see gear_sonic/data/assets/robot_description/urdf/k1/LICENSE. Meshes are unmodified; k1.xml drops the two
  camera bodies.
- K1 motor constants and the gain formula in gear_sonic/envs/manager_env/robots/k1.py follow Booster's
  BeyondMimic K1 configuration (booster_train).
- gear_sonic/scripts/eval_k1_mujoco.py is adapted from gear_sonic/scripts/eval_x2_mujoco.py of
  https://github.com/meetsitaram/GR00T-WholeBodyControl-X2 (Apache-2.0).

Training data
Training data includes Motion Data by Bones Studio (https://bones.studio/). Use of the underlying dataset is
subject to the BONES Motion Capture Dataset License Agreement. No motion data is included in this repository.

