held-out Bones-SEED clips retargeted to the Booster K1. They contain no human motion capture data. Training data
includes Motion Data by Bones Studio (https://bones.studio/). Use of the underlying dataset is subject to the BONES
Motion Capture Dataset License Agreement. Non-commercial use (CC BY-NC 4.0). See examples/k1/motions/README.md.
